### Ticketing API — sample requests (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP client)
@gw = http://localhost:8080
@email = demo-user@example.com
@password = Passw0rd123

### Health of every service
GET {{gw}}/api/status

### Register
POST {{gw}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}", "full_name": "Demo User"}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{gw}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}"}

@token = {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### My profile (created asynchronously from user.registered)
GET {{gw}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Events
# @name events
GET {{gw}}/api/events?city=Chisinau

@category = {{events.response.body.items[0].ticket_categories[0].id}}

### Book tickets
# @name booking
POST {{gw}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-1

{"category_id": "{{category}}", "quantity": 2}

### Booking status (PENDING_PAYMENT -> CONFIRMED)
GET {{gw}}/api/bookings/{{booking.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Payment of the booking
GET {{gw}}/api/payments/booking/{{booking.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Notifications
GET {{gw}}/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Aggregated dashboard
GET {{gw}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancel booking (tickets released, payment refunded)
POST {{gw}}/api/bookings/{{booking.response.body.id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Error examples
GET {{gw}}/api/bookings

###
POST {{gw}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "bad", "password": "1", "full_name": ""}
